       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "8. What permissions exist?"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "v1: one owner sees only THEIR fleet. Later (login): Admin edits schedules & deletes records; Technician can only add logs / fault reports; Viewer is read-only + export."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   }
